{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01432",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 5.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.67,
      "end_seconds": 10.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.97,
      "end_seconds": 19.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so so I thought I'd come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.8,
      "end_seconds": 23.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Right, yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.76,
      "end_seconds": 34.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Honestly, it's my face drooping on one side, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.59,
      "end_seconds": 37.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.71,
      "end_seconds": 40.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Probably ten days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.18,
      "end_seconds": 45.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.75,
      "end_seconds": 48.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I'd call it severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.81,
      "end_seconds": 57.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 57.12,
      "end_seconds": 62.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, you know, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.35,
      "end_seconds": 72.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.98,
      "end_seconds": 78.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "okay, that's fine, one at a time i'll ask about everything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.75,
      "end_seconds": 94.85,
      "duration_seconds": 15.1,
      "text": "Oh, and and a sudden headache. That's been about the same, about three months. I did have weakness in my right arm at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.94,
      "end_seconds": 102.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "Have you had your face drooping on one side before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.08,
      "end_seconds": 110.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened about six months ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.51,
      "end_seconds": 117.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, loss of consciousness or seizure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.76,
      "end_seconds": 121.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.2,
      "end_seconds": 127.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.23,
      "end_seconds": 131.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.24,
      "end_seconds": 135.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.6,
      "end_seconds": 138.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "yes, an irregular heartbeat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.28,
      "end_seconds": 141.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "hm, okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.41,
      "end_seconds": 145.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.44,
      "end_seconds": 156.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "Alright, high blood pressure, that matches what I have here. Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.96,
      "end_seconds": 161.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.29,
      "end_seconds": 174.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.22,
      "end_seconds": 182.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.84,
      "end_seconds": 185.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.09,
      "end_seconds": 194.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.35,
      "end_seconds": 198.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.19,
      "end_seconds": 203.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.99,
      "end_seconds": 208.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.3,
      "end_seconds": 218.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "It's bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.02,
      "end_seconds": 227.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.81,
      "end_seconds": 231.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.88,
      "end_seconds": 245.61,
      "duration_seconds": 13.73,
      "text": "For my pressure, I believe. My daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Before this I was on valsartan; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.09,
      "end_seconds": 259.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "So, what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.21,
      "end_seconds": 265.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol. My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.95,
      "end_seconds": 270.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.77,
      "end_seconds": 282.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.6,
      "end_seconds": 305.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 166 over 97, pulse is 93 beats a minute, respiratory rate 16, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.18,
      "end_seconds": 307.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.87,
      "end_seconds": 313.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.07,
      "end_seconds": 320.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.92,
      "end_seconds": 322.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.41,
      "end_seconds": 336.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Your right face droops, your right arm is weak and your speech is slurred."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.16,
      "end_seconds": 365.87,
      "duration_seconds": 25.71,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. So, based on the history and the examination, the most likely explanation is a possible stroke, within the treatment window. We shouldn't forget a migraine with aura. We should do an urgent CT scan of the head for possible stroke. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.97,
      "end_seconds": 369.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.18,
      "end_seconds": 375.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "I'll request a blood sugar test, it'll help with stroke symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.71,
      "end_seconds": 379.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.35,
      "end_seconds": 389.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Call an ambulance now, you need hospital immediately. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.77,
      "end_seconds": 394.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks"
    }
  ]
}